%% HAND-CURATED. sys-11 has zero seed — composed from spec §5 audit log design.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MutationHandler
    participant AuditBuffer
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant CloudWatchLogs

    MutationHandler->>AuditBuffer: append {actor_type, actor_id, action, resource_type, resource_id, details, ip, ua}

    alt buffer_overflow
        Note over AuditBuffer: in-memory > 100 entries OR > 5s since last flush → trigger flush
    else still buffering
        Note over AuditBuffer: hold until 100 entries or 5s
    end

    AuditBuffer->>PostgreSQL: BEGIN — INSERT batch into audit_log (role: audit_writer, INSERT-only)

    alt role_permission_denied
        PostgreSQL-->>AuditBuffer: permission denied (e.g. UPDATE attempted)
        Note over AuditBuffer: append-only invariant violated → P1
        AuditBuffer->>CloudWatchLogs: emit structured JSON as backup
    else batch_insert_retry_exhausted
        loop attempt 1..3 with backoff 200ms/400ms/800ms
            AuditBuffer->>PostgreSQL: INSERT batch
            PostgreSQL-->>AuditBuffer: error (deadlock, connection lost, etc)
        end
        Note over AuditBuffer,CloudWatchLogs: all 3 retries failed
        AuditBuffer->>CloudWatchLogs: emit each entry as JSON for offline replay
        Note over AuditBuffer: increment audit_log_write_failure_total
    else success
        PostgreSQL-->>AuditBuffer: COMMIT — N rows
        Note over AuditBuffer: audit_log_write_total += N
    end

    Note over MutationHandler,CloudWatchLogs: append-only enforced by audit_writer role (no UPDATE/DELETE) — daily 03:00 UTC retention sweep purges via audit_admin role (consent/deletion events excluded)
